    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Leisurely Fishing Experience</strong></h2>Fishing all day amidst an endless sea of clouds\u2014if there's anything more satisfying than that, it must be catching a rare Magic Flying Fish, an otherworldly Cubic Artifact, or even a glowing adorable kitten\u2014egg!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Beautiful Sky Island, Hatch and Raise Adorable Creatures</strong></h2>A floating sky island must have winding grapevine trellises, a babbling silver fountain, and enchanting creatures running around.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whimsical Aquariums</strong></h2>You and your little kittens, bears, or penguins can press your noses against the glass to gaze at the wondrous creatures (or maybe not-creatures) inside the aquarium: crown-wearing fish, unicorn-horned whales, and even mysterious swimming tires?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Leisurely Fishing Experience</strong></h2>Fishing all day amidst an endless sea of clouds\u2014if there's anything more satisfying than that, it must be catching a rare Magic Flying Fish, an otherworldly Cubic Artifact, or even a glowing adorable kitten\u2014egg!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Beautiful Sky Island, Hatch and Raise Adorable Creatures</strong></h2>A floating sky island must have winding grapevine trellises, a babbling silver fountain, and enchanting creatures running around.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whimsical Aquariums</strong></h2>You and your little kittens, bears, or penguins can press your noses against the glass to gaze at the wondrous creatures (or maybe not-creatures) inside the aquarium: crown-wearing fish, unicorn-horned whales, and even mysterious swimming tires?",
    "short_description": "&quot;Skytopia&quot; is a charming pixel-style fishing simulation idle game. Decorate a beautiful sky island at the base of your desktop, immerse yourself in a relaxing fishing lifestyle, and hatch and nurture a variety of adorable animals on the island.",
